  "name": "claudeconnect",
  "version": "2.17.0",
  "released": "2026-10-21",
  "notes": [
    "When Remote can't see or control your Mac because it hasn't been allowed yet, the Remote page now shows which permissions are still off (Screen Recording to see the screen, Accessibility to use the mouse and keyboard) and an Ask my Mac for permission button.",
    "The button has your Mac show macOS's request again and opens the right Settings panes on the Mac, so you can turn them on there — handy when you're away and set Remote up from your phone. You still approve on the Mac itself; macOS only accepts it there, and the screen then appears here on its own.",
    "A control error now offers the same Ask my Mac again right where it appears."
  ],
